  "description": "The Acoustic MCP connects Claude directly to our platform, giving it the ability to run analytics and build marketing campaigns using your live customer data. It's built around four data pillars: Contacts (profiles, identities, preferences), Products (catalog, pricing, inventory), Behaviors (events, engagement, purchase history), and Campaigns (sends, segments, performance).\n\nWith it, Claude can query across these pillars to answer analytics questions in plain language, and it can act: building audience segments, drafting messages, and assembling cross-channel campaigns without you touching the Connect UI directly.",
